  "question": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6eaa6600-ba0e-42cc-9552-0d1c43adcbcb-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 148px;\" /></p><p>Consider a gas of triatomic molecules. The molecules&nbsp; are assumed to be triangular and made of massless rigid rods whose vertices are occupied by atoms. The internal energy of a mole of the gas at temperature T is:</p>",
    "image": null
  },
